<p>Case submitted: {{{Case.Received_On__c}}}</p>

<hr />
<p>Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},</p>

<p>We have tried to call you to confirm your bank details for your Qantas reimbursement claim as your secure portal link has expired.</p>

<p>Please reply to this email within 7 days with a preferred time for us to call you back to assist you. If we don&rsquo;t hear back from you after 7 days, your claim will be closed. You will then need to contact us to organise your reimbursement.</p>

<h3>Need Help?</h3>

<p>Call us on 13 13 13 (in Australia) or your local Qantas Office <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/support/contact-us.html">here</a> for assistance.</p>

<p>Have your Customer care reference number {{{Case.Top_Parent_Case__c}}}&nbsp;ready to enter.&nbsp;</p>
